# The Quota slice: what a finished run leaves in the world record for the next (engine: save/worldrecord.mjs).
# Gameplay engineer, 2026-10-22. The lore facts a run finds are kept as well (q_lore.lwd gives:). The next run,
# whatever its class, reads them with prior(...), and the last character's line and the stones as variables.

@worldfact world.dead.tomas
when: has(q.tomas_held)
about: Tomas Haldane died in the end cell on day 45; the doctor said intestinal; he went into the corner past the gap with no board.

@worldfact world.anni_home
when: has(q.anni_sent)
about: Anni Haldane went to the Furrow Church's home on Tilney Road.

@worldfact world.will_down
when: has(q.will_down)
about: Will Brack went down under the granary door.

@var prior_line
default: 
@var prior_who
default: 
@var prior_stones
default: 
@var prior_runs
default: 0
